// Axiom Compiler — ABI Stability Verification & Boundary Typechecker (compiler/abi/stability/mod.ax)
// Implements SPEC-114 §§1..2 & §6 (AXS-ABI-001..017, AXS-ABI-030, AXS-ABI-050; REQ-ECO-8734, REQ-PKG-024, INV-SABI-001).

module compiler.abi.stability

